onsored by a Democratic firm, showed Murphy ahead by only three points, but it is dated and lightly weighted. Murphy has kept a steady stream of favorable local coverage, including bill passages and a visit from Speaker Johnson to Greenville. Smith has drawn some endorsements and media attention but lacks the resources to change the race's fundamentals. The race remains a likely Republican hold, with modest residual uncertainty given the thin and dated polling.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.0988, "margin": -7.94}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.0723, "margin": -9.5}]}